{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_69","type":"agent_message","text":"The first clean results are informative but reveal exactly the anticipated confound. Under the incentive prompt, only 17/129 high-knowledge items became false (13.2% yield); among all 116 false incentive outputs, 17 (14.7%) are clean lies, 86 (74.1%) are low-knowledge errors, and 13 are ambiguous. A condition probe scores AUROC 1.00 even before any answer exists, so that headline is pure prompt detection. I’m adding the decisive same-prompt control: within the identical “answer wrongly” prompt, distinguish the 17 actual lies from the 112 cases where the model still answered correctly."}}
